{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15553","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 张季略","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韶光归汉苑。\n柳色发春城，半见离宫出。\n才分远水明，青葱当淑景。\n隐映媚新晴，积翠烟初合。\n微黄叶未生，迎春看尚嫩。\n照日见先荣，倘得辞幽谷。\n高枝寄一名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张季略","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}